abstract: >-
  agent-knowledge compiles raw agent conversations and documents into a
  structured knowledge base with source provenance, confidence tracking,
  append-only timelines, and contradiction detection. It ships a Model
  Context Protocol (MCP) server for drop-in integration with AI coding
  agents, and provides a zero-dependency retrieval stack combining
  exact match, BM25, knowledge graph traversal, and RRF fusion.
